  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You learn to harness your reptilian ferocity and master a devastating combat technique.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Base attack bonus +1, sobek.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When you make a successful CMB check to initiate or maintain a grapple, you may perform a death roll. As you cling to your foe, you tuck in your legs and roll rapidly, twisting and wrenching your victim. You inflict your bite damage and knock the creature prone. For each point of essence invested in your racial bite ability, you gain a +1 racial bonus to your CMB on grapple checks.</p>\n<p>You gain 1 point of essence.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/akashic-feats#toc17\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
